{"id":20056,"slug":"20056-lam-the-nao-de-viet-component-react-accessible-a11y-vai-tro-cua-semantic-html-ar","category":"React","subcategory":"Accessibility (a11y)","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Làm thế nào để viết component React accessible (a11y)? Vai trò của semantic HTML, ARIA, focus management và useId là gì?","question_en":"How do you write accessible (a11y) React components? What roles do semantic HTML, ARIA, focus management and useId play?","answer_vi":"Accessibility không phải tính năng thêm, mà là cách build mặc định.\n\n- **Semantic HTML trước tiên**: dùng `<button>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<label>` thay vì `<div onClick>`. Native element có sẵn role, keyboard handling, focus — ARIA chỉ để *vá* khi không có element phù hợp. \"No ARIA is better than bad ARIA.\"\n- **ARIA khi cần**: `aria-label`, `aria-expanded`, `role=\"dialog\"`, `aria-live` cho nội dung động (toast, validation). ARIA chỉ đổi cách screen reader đọc, **không** thêm hành vi.\n- **Focus management**: khi mở modal phải move focus vào trong và trap nó; khi đóng phải trả focus về trigger. Route change nên focus heading. Đừng để focus rơi vào `<body>`.\n- **useId cho label**: tạo id ổn định, duy nhất, khớp giữa server và client (SSR) để nối `<label htmlFor>` với `<input id>` hay `aria-describedby`. **Đừng** dùng cho key trong list.\n\n```tsx\nfunction Field({ label }) {\n  const id = useId()\n  return (\n    <>\n      <label htmlFor={id}>{label}</label>\n      <input id={id} aria-describedby={`${id}-hint`} />\n      <p id={`${id}-hint`}>Hint text</p>\n    </>\n  )\n}\n```","answer_en":"Accessibility isn't an add-on; it's the default way you build.\n\n- **Semantic HTML first**: use `<button>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<label>` instead of `<div onClick>`. Native elements ship roles, keyboard handling and focus — ARIA only *patches* when no element fits. \"No ARIA is better than bad ARIA.\"\n- **ARIA when needed**: `aria-label`, `aria-expanded`, `role=\"dialog\"`, `aria-live` for dynamic content (toasts, validation). ARIA only changes how a screen reader announces — it adds **no** behavior.\n- **Focus management**: opening a modal must move focus inside and trap it; closing must return focus to the trigger. Route changes should focus the heading. Don't let focus fall to `<body>`.\n- **useId for labels**: generates a stable, unique id matching across server and client (SSR) to wire `<label htmlFor>` to `<input id>` or `aria-describedby`. **Avoid** use it for list keys.\n\n```tsx\nfunction Field({ label }) {\n  const id = useId()\n  return (\n    <>\n      <label htmlFor={id}>{label}</label>\n      <input id={id} aria-describedby={`${id}-hint`} />\n      <p id={`${id}-hint`}>Hint text</p>\n    </>\n  )\n}\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Accessibility không phải tính năng thêm, mà là cách build mặc định.</p><ul class=\"qa-points\"><li><strong>Semantic HTML trước tiên</strong>: dùng <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> thay vì <code>&lt;div onClick&gt;</code>. Native element có sẵn role, keyboard handling, focus — ARIA chỉ để <em>vá</em> khi không có element phù hợp. \"No ARIA is better than bad ARIA.\"</li><li><strong>ARIA khi cần</strong>: <code>aria-label</code>, <code>aria-expanded</code>, <code>role=\"dialog\"</code>, <code>aria-live</code> cho nội dung động (toast, validation). ARIA chỉ đổi cách screen reader đọc, <strong>không</strong> thêm hành vi.</li><li><strong>Focus management</strong>: khi mở modal phải move focus vào trong và trap nó; khi đóng phải trả focus về trigger. Route change nên focus heading. Đừng để focus rơi vào <code>&lt;body&gt;</code>.</li><li><strong>useId cho label</strong>: tạo id ổn định, duy nhất, khớp giữa server và client (SSR) để nối <code>&lt;label htmlFor&gt;</code> với <code>&lt;input id&gt;</code> hay <code>aria-describedby</code>. <strong>Đừng</strong> dùng cho key trong list.</li></ul><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">tsx</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function Field({ label }) {\n  const id = useId()\n  return (\n    &lt;&gt;\n      &lt;label htmlFor={id}&gt;{label}&lt;/label&gt;\n      &lt;input id={id} aria-describedby={`${id}-hint`} /&gt;\n      &lt;p id={`${id}-hint`}&gt;Hint text&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;/&gt;\n  )\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Field</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ label }</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> id = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useId</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> (\n    <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">htmlFor</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{id}</span>&gt;</span>{label}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{id}</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-describedby</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{</span>`${<span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>}<span class=\"hljs-attr\">-hint</span>`} /&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{</span>`${<span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>}<span class=\"hljs-attr\">-hint</span>`}&gt;</span>Hint text<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/&gt;</span></span>\n  )\n}</code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Accessibility isn't an add-on; it's the default way you build.</p><ul class=\"qa-points\"><li><strong>Semantic HTML first</strong>: use <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> instead of <code>&lt;div onClick&gt;</code>. Native elements ship roles, keyboard handling and focus — ARIA only <em>patches</em> when no element fits. \"No ARIA is better than bad ARIA.\"</li><li><strong>ARIA when needed</strong>: <code>aria-label</code>, <code>aria-expanded</code>, <code>role=\"dialog\"</code>, <code>aria-live</code> for dynamic content (toasts, validation). ARIA only changes how a screen reader announces — it adds <strong>no</strong> behavior.</li><li><strong>Focus management</strong>: opening a modal must move focus inside and trap it; closing must return focus to the trigger. Route changes should focus the heading. Don't let focus fall to <code>&lt;body&gt;</code>.</li><li><strong>useId for labels</strong>: generates a stable, unique id matching across server and client (SSR) to wire <code>&lt;label htmlFor&gt;</code> to <code>&lt;input id&gt;</code> or <code>aria-describedby</code>. <strong>Avoid</strong> use it for list keys.</li></ul><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">tsx</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function Field({ label }) {\n  const id = useId()\n  return (\n    &lt;&gt;\n      &lt;label htmlFor={id}&gt;{label}&lt;/label&gt;\n      &lt;input id={id} aria-describedby={`${id}-hint`} /&gt;\n      &lt;p id={`${id}-hint`}&gt;Hint text&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;/&gt;\n  )\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Field</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ label }</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> id = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useId</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> (\n    <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">htmlFor</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{id}</span>&gt;</span>{label}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{id}</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-describedby</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{</span>`${<span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>}<span class=\"hljs-attr\">-hint</span>`} /&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{</span>`${<span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>}<span class=\"hljs-attr\">-hint</span>`}&gt;</span>Hint text<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/&gt;</span></span>\n  )\n}</code></pre></div>","references":[{"label":"react.dev — useId","url":"https://react.dev/reference/react/useId"},{"label":"MDN — ARIA basics","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/401-jsx-la-gi-va-tai-sao-react-su-dung-no","title":"JSX là gì và tại sao React sử dụng nó?"},{"url":"/q/402-trinh-duyet-khong-hieu-jsx-vay-cuoi-cung-jsx-chay-thanh-gi","title":"Trình duyệt không hiểu JSX — vậy cuối cùng JSX chạy thành gì?"},{"url":"/q/403-trong-react-render-co-dieu-kien-lam-bang-nhung-cach-nao","title":"Trong React, render có điều kiện làm bằng những cách nào?"},{"url":"/q/404-react-fragment-la-gi-va-khi-nao-nen-su-dung","title":"React Fragment là gì và khi nào nên sử dụng?"},{"url":"/q/405-key-prop-trong-react-la-gi-va-tai-sao-no-quan-trong","title":"Key prop trong React là gì và tại sao nó quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/408-su-khac-nhau-giua-bieu-thuc-va-cau-lenh-trong-jsx-la-gi","title":"Sự khác nhau giữa biểu thức và câu lệnh trong JSX là gì?"},{"url":"/q/410-event-handling-trong-jsx-khac-gi-so-voi-html-thuan","title":"Event handling trong JSX khác gì so với HTML thuần?"},{"url":"/q/412-spread-operator-trong-jsx-props-duoc-dung-nhu-the-nao","title":"Spread operator trong JSX props được dùng như thế nào?"}]}